Error: Jet.MethodReadWithoutCall: This bound `^self` method value would change a copy of `counter`
  --> Tests/UI/bound_write_method_copies_receiver.jet:15:34
    |
 15 |     holder: Holder{bump: counter.bump}
    |                                  ^^^^
 Why: Stored or passed on, a function value keeps a copy of `counter`, so the method's changes would land on that copy and never reach `counter`
 Fix: Call the method where the change is needed, or pass the value straight to the call that runs it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MethodReadWithoutCall
